    "sections": {
        "description": "Thryve Biz Agency is a modern Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme crafted specifically for agencies, consulting firms, and professional service providers. Built entirely with Gutenberg blocks, it offers a seamless, code-free customization experience, allowing you to design and manage your website with ease. Its clean, professional design, fast performance, and fully responsive layouts ensure your agency presents a polished image across all devices. With full WooCommerce compatibility, Thryve Biz Agency is perfect for showcasing services, building client-focused platforms, and even launching online stores—making it a flexible and reliable solution for creative agencies, digital studios, and growing businesses."
    },
